          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Brian Barbisch",
          "email": "brbarbis@microsoft.com",
          "date": "2026-04-29 19:20:33.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Brian Barbisch",
          "email": "brbarbis@microsoft.com",
          "date": "2026-05-11 12:08:44.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-20178 llite: client integration and server-side hints",
        "message": "LU-20178 llite: client integration and server-side hints\n\nWire CSDC compression into the Lustre client (llite)\nlayer and add server-side awareness of compressed data:\n\n- llite/file.c: propagate compression parameters from\n  the composite layout to cl_page during I/O setup,\n  reject O_DIRECT for compressed files\n- llite/rw.c: chunk-aware readahead that rounds read\n  extents to compression chunk boundaries\n- llite/vvp_io.c: hybrid I/O handling for compressed\n  files in the VVP layer\n- llite/xattr.c: compression attribute handling\n- llite/llite_lib.c: negotiate OBD_CONNECT2_COMPRESS\n  with the server during client mount\n- lprocfs_status.c: add connect flag display strings\n  for compression capability\n- osd-ldiskfs: pass compression hint flags through to\n  the block layer for server-side awareness\n- ptlrpc/pack_generic.c: handle compression fields in\n  wire protocol packing/unpacking\n- ldlm/ldlm_extent.c: align DLM extent locks to\n  compression chunk boundaries\n\nSigned-off-by: Brian Barbisch <brbarbis@microsoft.com>\nTest-Parameters: Ignore\nChange-Id: I4591ee05d9f28a4126429320ca57f3a6f72f6d2f\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
